{"v":4,"catch":"Capcom街機名作以收藏合集形式登場！\n只要下載本體，就會附送《1943 - Midway Kaisen -》！","desc":"射擊、動作、格鬥……在充滿當年氛圍的模擬街機上，遊玩懷舊的街機名作！盛載大量原版中沒有的有趣功能！\n\n■完整地再現當時的氛圍\n以3D呈現的街機螢幕和掃瞄線等，細緻的顯示設定把當時的氛圍完整地再現！\n各式各樣的設定可供選擇，按照自己的喜好來自定義遊戲吧！\n\n■全新體驗，全新遊玩感覺\n玩家可以通過各種有趣的功能來體驗新的遊玩方法，例如「倒帶」功能、可變更遊戲速度以及隨時隨地儲存／載入！\n所有遊戲都設有排行榜，與世界各地的玩家進行競賽吧！\n在你喜愛的Capcom街機上遊玩各種功能，體驗全新遊玩感覺！\n\n■收錄作品\n《1943 - Midway Kaisen -》\n遊玩人數：1-2人 合作\n類型：SHOOTING\n收錄版本：日文及英文","publisher":"CAPCOM","release":"2025-10-02","genres":["街機","動作","格鬥","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 1.5GB / Switch 1.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/27d2038adc2d70a61581023ceb01480581ee13cc02b0c6ca8812796a5a1ef135.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/728fb7a5ffa5860e55bc72a050739594d4b19338617583957eced4a95cae6f16.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f424ab09a9c76c54ed89315a16a22884606bcf63c5cee5c21346360330abec53.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f308d3d93f7dff7a11de7d37aaf5142e6cf2a44789d0871ef0b12f99deba21ac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f630b498920c3cbcdd4a4b74952e5f35f550e987c89f8a79ba01906ce1340364.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46819b18ea543870ddbdd0db2efeb340b3ef144e2bf3d31521b5572101d639f2.jpg"],"titleId":"01001e0013208000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000025021","name":"Capcom Arcade Stadium: Vulgus","img":"21c2317c1e6f7d2ce8bd293c330067964ccdafa55e2d4e48e78c18a78cd1dcab","date":"2025-10-02","mem":false},{"id":"70050000025422","name":"Capcom Arcade Stadium: Higemaru","img":"f85b68a97e89bfec1737918efa94d4925b27da7012ea7fbf4be556e10ce21be9","date":"2025-10-02","mem":false},{"id":"70050000025424","name":"Capcom Arcade Stadium: 1942","img":"65e6aeb4b99a053b0330b7a31291e44ea2f6953afdfdd1236ddb382895620671","date":"2025-10-02","mem":false},{"id":"70050000025429","name":"Capcom Arcade Stadium: Senjo no Okami","img":"d91acf27a125115a770fe755